# WAL mode is on for hpc_tasks.db, and the write-ahead log routinely holds
# rows the .db file does not — 11 of 24 at one measurement. Ignoring the
# database without its sidecars would let a partial copy look complete.
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env
env.conf
*.prev
*.bak
*.log
